src/mlx_serve/ (generated by scripts/prepare.sh, not committed) holds the files of mlx-serve's src/ this plugin compiles,
at their mlx-serve paths, from the commit in MLX_SERVE_REF: the expert streamer (sdk/weights/streamed/, with its C read
pool) and what it reaches. overlay/mlx_serve/ is copied over it: the files in the script's EDGES list, which are this
plugin's own code at mlx-serve paths (mlx/ffi.zig and its neighbours, env.zig, sdk/util/log.zig, shared.zig,
sdk/ane/offload.zig follow plugins/turboexl3_qwen38's; mlx/ffi.zig's lower half is scripts/gen-mlx.py's output from the
kit's mlx-c headers; mlx_stream.zig is the streamer's module root), and plugins/minimax_m3/, the MiniMax port written for
mlx-serve (ddalcu/mlx-serve#1048 at b9c38f47, with the fixes from its review), as the script writes it from that tree.
A `stand_in` file is an empty one for an import nothing compiled uses.

